 NPO "TRIADA"
 SERVICE AND SUPPORT LINE
END

POST NEWS 1985-02-14 09:00 SERVICE
SUBJECT TRIADA-NET IS OPEN
DEAR USERS OF THE TRIADA-85,
FROM TODAY YOUR COMPUTER CAN CALL OTHER COMPUTERS. CONNECT THE MODEM, TYPE DIAL "0-00-00" AND YOU WILL SEE THE LIST OF PUBLIC NUMBERS.
PLEASE BE PATIENT: THE LINE CARRIES TWO CHARACTERS PER FRAME. A FULL SCREEN TAKES FOUR SECONDS. THIS IS NORMAL.
THE TECHNICAL SERVICE.
.

POST NEWS 1985-06-03 10:30 SERVICE
SUBJECT TRIBASIC V1.0 IN EVERY ROM
ALL TRIADA-85 COMPUTERS LEAVING THE WORKS NOW START IN TRIBASIC. TYPE MON FOR THE MONITOR, BASIC TO COME BACK.
REMEMBER THAT AN IF HAS THREE ANSWERS: THEN, MAYBE AND ELSE. THE MANUAL, CHAPTER 7, EXPLAINS IT WITH EXAMPLES.
.

POST NEWS 1985-10-21 11:15 SERVICE
SUBJECT TERM 1.0 ON EVERY DISK
EVERY NEW TRISKETTE CARRIES TERM.TRI, THE TERMINAL PROGRAM. BRUN "TERM" SHOWS THE PHONEBOOK; DIAL "NUMBER" CALLS AT ONCE.
WHILE CONNECTED, ESC AND THEN H HANGS UP. ESC AND THEN U SENDS A FILE FROM YOUR TRISKETTE.
.

POST HELP 1985-07-08 18:40 GLEB
SUBJECT MY SCREEN TURNED YELLOW
AFTER COLOR 11, -12 MY LETTERS ARE YELLOW AND I CANNOT GET THE BLUE BACK. IS THE TELEVISION BROKEN?
.

POST HELP 1985-07-09 08:20 SERVICE
SUBJECT RE: MY SCREEN TURNED YELLOW
THE TELEVISION IS FINE. TYPE COLOR 4, -12 TO HAVE THE FACTORY COLOURS BACK. SWITCHING THE COMPUTER OFF AND ON AGAIN ALSO DOES IT.
.

FILE PROGRAMS HELLO.TRI 1985-02-14 SERVICE
THE FIRST PROGRAM TO TRY. IT GREETS THE WORLD AND GOES BACK TO TRIBASIC.
.

FILE PROGRAMS COLORS.TRI 1985-03-01 SERVICE
ALL 27 COLOURS OF THE TRIADA-85 ON ONE SCREEN, FOR ADJUSTING YOUR TELEVISION.
.

# The Fourth State, step 2 (docs/net/STORY.md)
POST NEWS 1985-09-30 14:00 SERVICE
SUBJECT STABILITY CORRECTION
SOME EARLY MACHINES FROM TEST BENCH 4 MAY SHOW A SHORT FLICKER WHILE A TRIT CHANGES STATE. THIS IS HARMLESS.
OWNERS WHO WISH MAY RUN PATCH85.TRI FROM THE PROGRAMS AREA. IT CHECKS THE MACHINE AND PRINTS ITS CHECKSUM. NO ACTION IS NEEDED.
PLEASE DO NOT WRITE TO THE WORKS ABOUT IT.
.

FILE PROGRAMS PATCH85.TRI 1985-09-30 SERVICE
THE STABILITY CORRECTION FOR EARLY MACHINES (BENCH 4). RUN IT WITH BRUN.
.
